                    "line": 4,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Jason Bills",
                        "email": "jason.m.bills@linux.intel.com",
                        "username": "jmbills"
                    },
                    "message": "Maybe let's follow bmcweb and use the boostorg github source_url?\nhttps://github.com/openbmc/bmcweb/blob/master/subprojects/boost.wrap"
                },
                {
                    "file": "subprojects/boost.wrap",
                    "line": 4,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Bartosz Janicki",
                        "email": "bartosz.janicki@intel.com",
                        "username": "BartoszJanicki"
                    },
                    "message": "Switched to github source. However this would require to explicitly add source files as in bmcweb:\nhttps://github.com/openbmc/bmcweb/blob/f99bc45d579b751e693bd1655dfd623bd84475f8/meson.build#L384\n\nInstead followed a pattern from dbus-sensors:\nhttps://github.com/openbmc/dbus-sensors/commit/3b13725a3f8148a8f13032803763b26355d85f42"
                },
                {
                    "file": "subprojects/boost.wrap",
                    "line": 4,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Jason Bills",
                        "email": "jason.m.bills@linux.intel.com",
                        "username": "jmbills"
                    },
                    "message": "Done"
                },
                {
                    "file": "subprojects/packagefiles/boost/meson.build",
                    "line": 0,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Jason Bills",
                        "email": "jason.m.bills@linux.intel.com",
                        "username": "jmbills"
                    },
                    "message": "Do we still need this file?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "subprojects/packagefiles/boost/meson.build",
                    "line": 0,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Bartosz Janicki",
                        "email": "bartosz.janicki@intel.com",
                        "username": "BartoszJanicki"
                    },
                    "message": "Yes it is still needed. Boost does not use Meson as build system. Additionally we have to specify required modules."
                },
                {
                    "file": "subprojects/packagefiles/boost/meson.build",
                    "line": 0,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Jason Bills",
                        "email": "jason.m.bills@linux.intel.com",
                        "username": "jmbills"
                    },
                    "message": "Acknowledged"
                }
